          "observed_at": "2026-08-26T21:15:52.07+00:00",
          "raw_payload": {
            "connectorId": "bootshaus-official",
            "descriptionClean": "BLACKLIST & INURFASE pres.\n\nZAAGSTEP by Dr Donk\n\nFor years, electronic music has been built on genres.\n\nZaag. Uptempo. Hard Dance. Dubstep. Drum & Bass. Bass Music.\n\nBut what happens when the boundaries between them disappear?\n\nOn September 11th, BLACKLIST and INURFASE invite you to witness the official launch of ZAAGSTEP - the sound created by Dr Donk that combines the high BPM intensity of Uptempo and Zaag with the energy, and influence of Bass Music.\n\nA never-seen-before crossover between Dubstep, Zaag, Drum & Bass, Uptempo and everything in between. WELCOME TO ZAAGSTEP 😈\n\nTo celebrate his upcoming album release, Dr Donk presents the world's first full-scale ZAAGSTEP showcase at Bootshaus Cologne, featuring artists who have helped shape the sound and artists who represent the different worlds colliding within it.",
            "endsAt": "2026-09-12T06:00:00+02:00",
